"7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ComfyMathExpression"}, "order": 21}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#6d28d9", "widgets_values": ["## 原始音频源路径\n1. 同一个**加载音频（Load Audio）**输出，同时输入到 MiniMax 的 **ref_audio_0（参考音频0）** 和 **VRGDG MiniMax H3 音频驱动**节点。\n2. 提示词必须使用指定标签：`<Picture 1>` 和 `<Audio 1>`（示例：`<Picture 1>` 跟随 `<Audio 1>` 精准演唱并完成口型同步）。\n3. 紫色节点用于在采样器生成视频时，锁定已经编码完成的音频潜变量。\n4. 该节点的 **original_audio（原始音频）**输出直接送往所有最终视频合成节点。刻意不使用 H3 解码/生成出来的音频。\n5. **Duration（时长）**数值需要和选中的音频片段保持一致。`Video Combine（视频合成）`开启 **trim_to_audio（按音频裁切）**，作为最后的保障机制。\n\n> 术语注释\n> - latent：潜变量，AI模型中间编码数据\n> - lip‑sync：口型同步\n> - sampler：采样器\n> - trim_to_audio：以音频时长为准截断视频画面"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "IMPORTANT — Exact Audio / Lip-Sync Path", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#1e1b4b", "size": [887.4115600585938, 252.04991149902344], "pos": [-19.928627014160156, -327.927001953125], "id": 173, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.7.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["## Model Links\n[🤗 Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3)\n\n**vae**\n\n- [minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors)\n- [minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors)\n\n**diffusion_models**\n\n- [minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n\n**text_encoders**\n\n- [qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors)\n\n\n## Model Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 vae/\n│   │   ├── minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors\n│   │   └── minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │   └── minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 text_encoders/\n│       └── qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors\n```\n\n## Report Issue\n\nNote: Please update ComfyUI first ([guide](https://docs.comfy.org/installation/update_comfyui)) and prepare required models. Desktop/Cloud updates follow stable releases, so some nightly-supported models may not be available yet.\n\n- Cannot run / runtime errors: [ComfyUI/issues](https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI/issues)\n- UI / frontend issues: [ComfyUI_frontend/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI_frontend/issues)\n- Workflow issues: [workflow_templates/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/issues)\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: Model Links", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [440, 740], "pos": [-1832.3377685546875, -197.39413452148438], "id": 117, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["# MiniMax H3\n[MiniMax H3](https://www.minimax.io/blog/minimax-h3) 是 MiniMax 的通用多模态生成模型。它可同时理解文本、图像、视频与音频，并能生成**原生立体声音频**的视频：人声、音效、音乐在单次前向运算中统一建模，而非后期叠加合成。输出最高支持2K分辨率、24帧每秒，时长最长约15秒。\n\n## ComfyUI 相关链接\n- [ComfyUI#15224](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/15224)\n- [🤗 Comfy‑Org/MiniMax‑H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3)\n\n## 关于本工作流\n该模板使用 `MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo` 节点执行**参考图转视频（ref2va）**任务。\n可混合输入参考图片、参考视频以及独立音频，将这些素材融入生成过程，以此锁定人物形象、画面风格、动作、镜头运镜或是音色。\n\n### 关键输入参数\n- **ref_images / ref_videos / ref_video_audios / ref_audios**：最多9张参考图片、3段参考视频（每段视频可附带自身配对音轨）、3段独立参考音频片段\n- **prompt（提示词）**：按照节点接入的顺序，使用标签引用输入素材，例如 `<Picture 1>`、`<Video 1>`、`<Audio 1>`，之后再描述目标场景、动作与音频效果\n- **ref_image_size（参考图尺寸）**：\n  - `match`：将参考素材缩放至生成视频分辨率（速度更快）\n  - `max`：短边最大保留2048像素，人物形象还原度更高；但参考特征会参与每一步采样，会牺牲运行速度\n- **width / height（宽/高）**：通过分辨率选择器进行设置\n- **duration (seconds)（时长，单位秒）**：由数学表达式节点换算为合法的帧总长度 `length`\n\n### 采样与解码\n- 采样器：`res_multistep`。对于本类大量使用参考素材的提示词，调度器选择 `beta` 或 `normal` 的效果通常优于 `simple`\n- 采样器输出音视频联合的**潜变量(LATENT)**，直接同时送入 `VAEDecode`（视频，权重：`minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16`）与 `VAEDecodeAudio`（音频，权重：`minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32`）；两个解码节点会自动从打包潜变量中提取各自对应部分。之后 `CreateVideo` 将二者封装合并为音画同步的MP4文件\n- 本工作流扩散模型权重为 `minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors`，和文生视频/图生视频模板所使用的 `fl2va` 模型属于两套不同权重\n\n> ref2va 的生成结果对提示词措辞十分敏感；尽量精准使用参考标签，明确指定哪一份参考素材负责画面的哪一部分，更容易得到理想效果。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: MiniMax H3", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [1173.739990234375, 582.8369750976562], "pos": [-1324.163818359375, -133.82977294921875], "id": 116, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [278], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["672107cba65d3d83b4133c595fccf2438c4eb0c0000c197b70bf1b46052f4b7d.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [391.62713623046875, 326], "pos": [-492.4045715332031, 1066.8131103515625], "id": 137, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 1